# Controller Layer Rules

- Controllers handle HTTP routing, Swagger annotations, and DTO validation only.
- Controllers MUST delegate all business logic, orchestration, and transactions to Services.
- Controllers MUST NOT call Repositories directly.
- All endpoints must return the standardized response envelope `{ success, data, meta }`.
- Enforce strict permission checks via `@RequirePermissions('resource:action')` on all protected routes.
- Full details: [05-api-conventions.md](docs/ai/05-api-conventions.md)
